WEBVTT

00:00:04.616 --> 00:00:07.118
Stop laughing, all of you!

00:00:07.202 --> 00:00:09.871
CRASH (mocking):
Stop laughing, all of you!

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:12.123
(laughter continues)

00:00:12.207 --> 00:00:14.084
(high-pitched):
What's rule #1?

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:17.837
(all laughing)

00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:20.173
They're just laughing.
What's so bad about that?

00:00:20.257 --> 00:00:21.967
They died laughing!

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:23.718
(gasps)

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:27.097
Stop laughing!

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.516
You... you know
what's funny, though?

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.018
We're... we're trying to save Sid,

00:00:32.102 --> 00:00:34.145
and now we're all going to die!

00:00:34.229 --> 00:00:35.689
(all laughing)

00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:36.982
And I don't even like Sid.

00:00:37.065 --> 00:00:39.025
Who does?
He's an idiot.

00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:42.237
(laughing)

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.030
Thanks for getting me
into this mess.

00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:45.991
It's the most fun I've had in years.

00:00:46.074 --> 00:00:48.535
Thank you for deserting the herd.

00:00:48.618 --> 00:00:50.620
That was totally super.

00:00:51.413 --> 00:00:53.373
(all laughing)

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:55.166
(rattling, laughter stops)

00:00:56.293 --> 00:00:57.335
Coochie, coochie, coo!

00:00:57.419 --> 00:00:58.795
Stop that! (gasps)

00:00:59.337 --> 00:01:00.839
Don't you see?

00:01:00.922 --> 00:01:02.424
(high-pitched):
We're all going to die!

00:01:02.507 --> 00:01:05.760
(all laughing)

00:01:06.886 --> 00:01:07.804
(sighs)

00:01:07.887 --> 00:01:09.723
We got to do everything, huh?

00:01:10.849 --> 00:01:13.977
(grunting)

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.437
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.105
(laughing)

00:01:17.188 --> 00:01:19.190
And sometimes, I wet my bed!

00:01:19.274 --> 00:01:20.567
That's all right.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:21.943
Sometimes I wet your bed!

00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:23.987
(laughing)

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:25.780
(grunting)

00:01:25.864 --> 00:01:28.783
(laughing)

00:01:28.867 --> 00:01:31.119
(raspy laughter)

00:01:31.202 --> 00:01:33.038
(laughing stops)

00:01:33.121 --> 00:01:34.539
MANNY (normal voice):
Uh...

00:01:34.623 --> 00:01:37.250
I'm not sure how much
of that you could hear.

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:38.835
Oh, I heard all of it.

00:01:38.918 --> 00:01:41.004
Right. Yeah.

00:01:41.087 --> 00:01:42.339
You wet my bed?

00:01:42.422 --> 00:01:44.382
That was gas talk, dude.

00:01:44.466 --> 00:01:47.344
-Well, uh, better get moving.
-(Buck laughing)

00:01:47.427 --> 00:01:49.054
Aren't we forgetting something?

00:01:49.137 --> 00:01:51.806
(high-pitched):
Here, Rudy, Rudy, Rudy!

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.058
(laughing)

00:01:53.141 --> 00:01:54.934
I'm so lonely!

00:01:55.018 --> 00:01:57.020
(rapid panting)

00:01:59.439 --> 00:02:02.067
(high-pitched squealing)

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.152
(grunting, panting)

00:02:12.661 --> 00:02:14.079
SID:
Okay.

00:02:14.162 --> 00:02:15.205
Here you go, guys.

00:02:15.288 --> 00:02:16.831
Mangia, mangia.

00:02:17.957 --> 00:02:20.293
(all groan)

00:02:20.377 --> 00:02:21.419
(gasps) Ow!

00:02:21.503 --> 00:02:23.004
(muffled groaning)

00:02:23.088 --> 00:02:25.674
What? You're not going
to eat your vegetables?

00:02:25.757 --> 00:02:29.469
How are you going to become
big, strong dinosaurs?

00:02:29.552 --> 00:02:31.638
(gasps)

00:02:32.722 --> 00:02:33.556
(moans softly)

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.016
No, uh-uh.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.643
I've raised them vegetarian.

00:02:36.726 --> 00:02:38.353
It's a healthier lifestyle.

00:02:38.436 --> 00:02:42.482
I mean, look at me.
I have the pelt of a much younger sloth.

00:02:43.441 --> 00:02:44.859
Excuse me.

00:02:44.943 --> 00:02:46.820
I'm trying to have
a conversation here.

00:02:46.903 --> 00:02:47.987
-(yells)
-(low growling)

00:02:51.157 --> 00:02:53.326
(grunts)

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.829
No, no, no, no, no, no.
That's not for us, kids.

00:02:55.912 --> 00:02:59.416
It's way too feathery
and fleshy and...

00:02:59.499 --> 00:03:01.459
-and alive!
-(yells)

00:03:01.543 --> 00:03:04.212
(screaming)

00:03:05.213 --> 00:03:06.715
(clucking)

00:03:06.798 --> 00:03:08.299
(growling)

00:03:08.383 --> 00:03:09.509
No.

00:03:09.592 --> 00:03:12.429
No, no, no.
We do not eat live animals.

00:03:12.512 --> 00:03:13.680
Period.

00:03:13.763 --> 00:03:15.223
-Now, go.
-(clucking frantically)

00:03:15.306 --> 00:03:17.600
Fly. Be free.

00:03:17.684 --> 00:03:19.644
(clucking frantically)

00:03:19.728 --> 00:03:22.313
Little flightless bird.

00:03:22.397 --> 00:03:24.232
-(thud)
-(squawks)

00:03:24.315 --> 00:03:26.484
Uh, my bad.

00:03:26.568 --> 00:03:28.862
Hey, where you going?

00:03:28.945 --> 00:03:31.322
This is how you resolve conflict?

00:03:31.406 --> 00:03:32.615
No wonder you're single.

00:03:32.699 --> 00:03:34.451
(growls)

00:03:37.412 --> 00:03:39.914
Oh, come on,
am I talking to myself here?

00:03:39.998 --> 00:03:42.584
I say they're vegetarian,
you say, "Grr."

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:45.211
I say, "Can we talk about this?"
you say, "Grr."

00:03:45.295 --> 00:03:46.421
I don't call that communication.

00:03:46.504 --> 00:03:47.589
(growls)

00:03:47.672 --> 00:03:50.091
See? That's your answer
to everything.

00:03:52.969 --> 00:03:54.804
(belches)

00:03:54.888 --> 00:03:55.805
(sighs)

00:03:55.889 --> 00:03:56.890
(snorts proudly)

00:03:56.973 --> 00:03:59.893
(roaring in distance)

00:04:03.146 --> 00:04:04.522
What are you afraid of?

00:04:04.606 --> 00:04:06.232
You're the biggest thing on Earth.

00:04:06.983 --> 00:04:08.109
(chittering)

00:04:08.193 --> 00:04:09.652
(moans)

00:04:10.403 --> 00:04:11.404
Aren't you?

00:04:11.488 --> 00:04:12.739
(whimpers)

00:04:13.865 --> 00:04:15.033
Whoa!

00:04:15.366 --> 00:04:17.160
Hey!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.542
(thunderous rumble) (thunderous rumble)

00:04:24.626 --> 00:04:26.127
BUCK (deep voice):
They'll never survive.

00:04:26.211 --> 00:04:27.879
It's dangerous by day.

00:04:27.962 --> 00:04:29.756
(high-pitched):
But it's even worse at night.

00:04:29.839 --> 00:04:32.133
Plus, their guide is a lunatic!

00:04:32.217 --> 00:04:33.510
-What?
-You mean Buck?

00:04:33.593 --> 00:04:34.594
Oh, he's wacko.

00:04:34.677 --> 00:04:35.595
I am not!

00:04:35.678 --> 00:04:36.721
Totally bonkers.

00:04:36.805 --> 00:04:38.139
And his feet smell.

00:04:38.223 --> 00:04:39.724
-Shut up!
-You shut up.

00:04:39.808 --> 00:04:40.767
Oh, you little...

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.727
(grunting)
Ha-ha, gotcha!

00:04:42.811 --> 00:04:44.604
He's strangling his own foot.

00:04:44.687 --> 00:04:46.147
Shouldn't we get moving?

00:04:46.231 --> 00:04:47.398
What?

00:04:47.482 --> 00:04:49.150
And give Rudy
a midnight snack?

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:50.235
Not likely.

00:04:50.318 --> 00:04:51.236
The skull's right.

00:04:51.319 --> 00:04:52.362
Take a load off, mammals.

00:04:52.445 --> 00:04:53.571
We'll camp here.

00:04:53.655 --> 00:04:55.406
Now, who's hungry?

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:59.077
-I am!
-You don't need the calories!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.912
(roaring in distance)

00:05:03.331 --> 00:05:07.001
BUCK:
There I was, my back against the wall.

00:05:07.085 --> 00:05:09.504
No way out.

00:05:09.587 --> 00:05:12.924
Perched on the razor's edge
of oblivion.

00:05:13.007 --> 00:05:17.428
Staring into the eye
of the great white beast.

00:05:17.512 --> 00:05:19.722
(thunder crashing)

00:05:25.937 --> 00:05:28.064
-(gasps)
-(roaring)

00:05:28.147 --> 00:05:29.983
(screaming)

00:05:30.358 --> 00:05:31.818
(grunting)

00:05:32.318 --> 00:05:33.152
(groans)

00:05:33.236 --> 00:05:34.571
(panting)

00:05:34.654 --> 00:05:37.031
(roaring)

00:05:37.115 --> 00:05:38.825
(panting)

00:05:42.871 --> 00:05:44.706
(grunting, panting)

00:05:45.415 --> 00:05:46.583
(gasps)

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.713
(rumbling)

00:05:54.841 --> 00:05:58.052
(grunting)

00:06:02.056 --> 00:06:04.809
(panting)

00:06:04.893 --> 00:06:06.519
(deep growling)

00:06:06.603 --> 00:06:08.605
(gasps, pants)

